WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
- One way we rise on our
show is through connection,

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.800
so we thought we'd do a new segment

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.150
where we share our takes

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:10.320
on the most controversial
topics from past episodes,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.800
to see if we come to a consensus on any.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.640
This is...

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.073
♪ Finding common ground ♪

00:00:20.249 --> 00:00:21.408
- Okay, run!

00:00:21.408 --> 00:00:22.884
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:22.884 --> 00:00:24.330
All right, Jessi, with the run.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.410
- Yeah.
- Okay, so all we do

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.620
is hit this button and our super computer,

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.510
'cause it's totally
linked up to a computer,

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.270
will look back through
five seasons of shows

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.910
to find our most controversial subjects,

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:36.743
or topics, rather.

00:00:36.743 --> 00:00:39.180
Then we're gonna try to
settle things on each topic.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.766
We're gonna settle it
right here, are you ready?

00:00:40.766 --> 00:00:41.599
- Okay, I'm ready to settle.

00:00:41.599 --> 00:00:43.050
- All right, boom.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.070
Well, don't be ready to settle,

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.067
that's not a way to live.

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:46.350
(Kelly and Common laugh)

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:47.670
Ooh!

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.440
Can, okay, okay.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.300
This one came up from Jon Cryer,
when I was talking to him.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.430
And can you be friends with an ex?

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.418
- Yes, I could definitely
be friends with a ex.

00:00:55.418 --> 00:00:56.272
I mean-

00:00:56.272 --> 00:00:58.862
- Like, how long was the relationship?

00:00:58.862 --> 00:00:59.962
(audience laughs)

00:00:59.962 --> 00:01:01.140
- I mean, I've been friends

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:02.730
with a lot of exes that I've had,

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:04.410
and they've been long relationships,

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.030
'cause most of 'em end pretty good.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.570
I mean, we go through stuff at
the beginning of the breakup,

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:11.670
but then once we come to our grounds,

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:15.000
it's like, we both, we good
people, we cool people.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.973
Are you friends with any of your exes?

00:01:16.973 --> 00:01:17.806
- No.

00:01:17.806 --> 00:01:21.929
(audience laughs and applauds)

00:01:21.929 --> 00:01:23.338
I mean, here's the thing.

00:01:23.338 --> 00:01:24.720
- No, ain't no judgment.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:25.800
No judgment.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.840
- I'm not not friends, but I feel like,

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.160
because I'm cool with-

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:32.653
I only have a couple that
I'm just like, hard pass.

00:01:32.653 --> 00:01:33.690
(Common and audience laugh)

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:34.523
But no.

00:01:34.523 --> 00:01:35.820
But, you know, a couple of them, though,

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.140
I don't have many exes, but like,

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.910
a couple of them are cool people.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.320
Nothing wrong with them.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.750
If we ran into each other,
we'd be totally friendly.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.005
But that's the difference.
- What if they invited you?

00:01:44.005 --> 00:01:46.740
If they invited you to a party with like,

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.450
like, they said, "Man, we having a party"

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:49.283
for some of their family members.

00:01:49.283 --> 00:01:51.120
- Yeah, depending on the ex.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.770
Yeah, no, I would be like, "Okay, cool.

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:53.603
Yeah, I'll show up."

00:01:53.603 --> 00:01:57.720
Like, I just feel like
it can get awkward for-

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.637
It depends on who ended it
- Did that person-

00:01:59.637 --> 00:02:01.380
Yeah.
- Or who it is.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:02.929
And it depends, it's situational.

00:02:02.929 --> 00:02:04.470
- Yeah. (laughs)
- Yeah, yeah.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.150
- But for mostly, no.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.650
No, no. (laughs)

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:08.640
I feel like that's awkward.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:09.843
No common ground there.

